cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Agnostic SHAPES Core project in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Agnostic SHAPES Core"
abstract: >
  Agnostic SHAPES Core is a structural framework for finite rooted non-plane
  forms. SHAPES provides the interpretation-agnostic carrier, structural
  equality, intrinsic multiplicity, and elementary ADD and REMOVE edits.
  Interpretation layers are pluggable and depend on SHAPES rather than
  defining it. PETRA — Prime Exponent Tower Recursive Algebra — is one such
  maintained layer, providing prime/exponent interpretations including the
  LRPE policy.
